  manifest carries a `webrtc_config` object that Holochain passes VERBATIM into tx5's
  serde-camelCase `WebRtcConfig` — so the ICE-server key MUST be `iceServers`; the snake_case
  `ice_servers` is an unknown field, silently dropped, and the fleet runs with ZERO ICE servers
  (the fleet-inception→2026-05-27 silent WebRTC loss, museum defect class #1). The render gate
